The Associate of Arts (AA) degree in Liberal Arts – Major in Theatre is designed to provide the courses in general education for the student who plans to complete a baccalaureate degree in pursuit of a theatre degree at a four-year institution.

In addition to the admission requirements established for the college, entry into the Associate of Arts Degree Program in Liberal Arts – Major in Theatre has no additional requirements. Students with deficiencies in reading, writing, or mathematics may be required to take developmental studies.

